        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synopsis</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short, chill game about managing a ramen stall-front to distribute contraband 'cute-ware' to the masses in rebellion against a nation-wide strict anti-aesthetic policy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a year ushering in peace after a large civil war broke out and claimed millions of lives in the city, the triumphant party declared a nation-wide policy of anti-aesthetics, leading a propaganda campaign to blame the war on 'vapid aesthetics' and 'excessive emphasis on frivolous positivity'.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Any article found to be cute will immediately be deemed contraband and illegal to possess. You are tasked by the Rebellion to subvert the Ministry's narrative by distributing various 'cute-ware' to the masses via a ramen stall front.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect a wide variety of items from various gachapon machines to supply your agenda</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518560/extras/1e86f59e9fddc82c53b8396b9405b92d.poster.avif?t=1782224098\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518560/extras/1e86f59e9fddc82c53b8396b9405b92d.webm?t=1782224098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518560/extras/1e86f59e9fddc82c53b8396b9405b92d.mp4?t=1782224098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optimize your sales by figuring the best possible configuration of items to be put on your stall's sale grid</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518560/extras/29eb089bb809b79b8dc82c4b45b0a8cf.poster.avif?t=1782224098\" width=780 height=442 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518560/extras/29eb089bb809b79b8dc82c4b45b0a8cf.webm?t=1782224098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518560/extras/29eb089bb809b79b8dc82c4b45b0a8cf.mp4?t=1782224098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover many combinations of items that can be used to forge better items</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518560/extras/e9032cfed808564294b199fc3ac4996a.poster.avif?t=1782224098\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518560/extras/e9032cfed808564294b199fc3ac4996a.webm?t=1782224098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518560/extras/e9032cfed808564294b199fc3ac4996a.mp4?t=1782224098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategize how to maximize your sales by making use of the various sales effects that forged items possess</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518560/extras/690a321e383ce8c17306fd6148c089b8.poster.avif?t=1782224098\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518560/extras/690a321e383ce8c17306fd6148c089b8.webm?t=1782224098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518560/extras/690a321e383ce8c17306fd6148c089b8.mp4?t=1782224098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automate the various processes in the production pipeline to improve productivity</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518560/extras/764c81fb5572bc94dfd0b2c0518e02bb.poster.avif?t=1782224098\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518560/extras/764c81fb5572bc94dfd0b2c0518e02bb.webm?t=1782224098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518560/extras/764c81fb5572bc94dfd0b2c0518e02bb.mp4?t=1782224098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand your rebellion's influence in the area by adding more stalls and gachapon machines to your disposal</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518560/extras/f8dc4d5b767d57cafb453e8c3d2a490f.poster.avif?t=1782224098\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518560/extras/f8dc4d5b767d57cafb453e8c3d2a490f.webm?t=1782224098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518560/extras/f8dc4d5b767d57cafb453e8c3d2a490f.mp4?t=1782224098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Whole new Arcade mode!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3